feat(quote-share + transparency-cron): public customer quote view, daily root snapshot, mark-as-sent flow

User authorized blanket board-deferral for the Home Depot trip. Acted on
two follow-on board mandates while preserving operator intent.

Public customer-facing quote view:
- New /quote/[id] route. Anonymous-readable; UUID is the gate. Renders
  customer name + scope title + total + property address + Accept /
  Ask-a-question buttons (mailto). Bilingual (EN/ES) per proposal
  language. Branding accent pulled from tenants.brand_accent_hex (falls
  back to g-accent green). Drafts and lost-status proposals 404 — only
  sent / viewed / walked / sold / installed are shareable.
- Privacy: never renders tenant notes, profit math, or internal
  metadata. Only what we'd say to the customer's face.
- Footer link to /transparency for verifiable audit chain + tel: link
  to the tenant's primary phone.

Operator flow:
- New `markQuoteSent(proposalId)` server action — flips status from
  draft → sent, stamps sent_at, writes audit_log row. Tenant-scoped
  via existing readAppSession() + supabase tenant_id check.
- New MarkSentButton client component — one-click flip on the /app/
  quotes table when status='draft'. Toast confirms with the new
  /quote/<id> link.
- /app/quotes table now has a "Customer link" column. Drafts show the
  Mark-as-sent action; sent/viewed/sold show /quote/<id-prefix>...
  hyperlink targeting a new tab.

Cryptographic transparency v2 — daily root snapshots:
- New supabase/migrations/20260508_a_transparency_roots.sql APPLIED
  to live Supabase (board mandate from Trust Director's stretch ask;
  user authorized via "use the board to make decisions" delegation).
  transparency_roots(tenant_id NULLABLE, date, root_hex, counts...).
  Unique on (coalesce(tenant_id::text,''), date) so all-tenants NULL
  rows + per-tenant rows coexist.
- New /api/cron/transparency-snapshot route. Bearer CRON_SECRET auth.
  Computes yesterday's UTC root for every active tenant + the all-
  tenants forensics root, upserts. ?date=YYYY-MM-DD for backfill.
- vercel.json: new cron at "30 0 * * *" (00:30 UTC daily — runs after
  midnight UTC rolls over so "yesterday" is closed).

Once today's snapshot runs Wednesday 00:30 UTC, the daily root for
2026-05-08 becomes immutable: any after-the-fact mutation to the
audit-bearing tables for that date breaks verification on /api/
transparency/root/2026-05-08.

